---
---

<section id="about" data-animate class="py-32 px-6 relative">
  <!-- Subtle divider -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full max-w-4xl">
    <div class="line-glow opacity-20"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-20" data-reveal>
      <span class="text-xs tracking-[0.3em] text-eclipse/60 font-body uppercase mb-4 block">Who we are</span>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">
        About Techne
      </h2>
      <div class="w-16 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-apollo to-artemis mx-auto"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Concept -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-20" data-reveal>
      <p class="text-lg text-artemis/70 leading-relaxed font-body mb-8">
        <span class="text-gradient-gold font-heading font-semibold text-2xl">Τέχνη</span>
        — the Greek concept of art, craft, and mastery. 
        We chose this name because we believe software development is a craft: 
        it requires skill, intention, and relentless pursuit of quality.
      </p>
      <p class="text-artemis/50 leading-relaxed font-body">
        Our identity is built on the duality of the sun and the moon — 
        always active, always watching, always building. 
        Like Apollo and Artemis, we never sleep so your projects never stop.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Team cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Ed -->
      <div data-reveal class="group text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-carbon/30 border border-shadow/40 hover:border-eclipse/30 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-eclipse/10 border border-eclipse/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C49A5A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-semibold text-marble mb-1">Ed</h3>
        <p class="text-xs tracking-widest text-eclipse/60 uppercase mb-3 font-body">Founder & Developer</p>
        <p class="text-artemis/40 text-sm font-body leading-relaxed">
          Full-stack developer & DevOps. The architect behind every project.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Artemisa -->
      <div data-reveal class="group text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-carbon/30 border border-shadow/40 hover:border-artemis/30 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-artemis/10 border border-artemis/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
          <span class="text-2xl">🌙</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-semibold text-marble mb-1">Artemisa</h3>
        <p class="text-xs tracking-widest text-artemis/60 uppercase mb-3 font-body">AI Assistant</p>
        <p class="text-artemis/40 text-sm font-body leading-relaxed">
          The moon — precision, calm, and unwavering attention to detail.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Apolo -->
      <div data-reveal class="group text-center p-8 rounded-2xl bg-carbon/30 border border-shadow/40 hover:border-apollo/30 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-apollo/10 border border-apollo/20 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
          <span class="text-2xl">☀️</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-semibold text-marble mb-1">Apolo</h3>
        <p class="text-xs tracking-widest text-apollo/60 uppercase mb-3 font-body">AI Assistant</p>
        <p class="text-artemis/40 text-sm font-body leading-relaxed">
          The sun — energy, action, and relentless drive to ship.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
